(7548735, 1209002, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome picture.  The processing is handled artfully.  After that thread about fake sunbeams I''m now always wondering.  That''s a shame, but I''m not judging on this image.  Wonderful atmosphere.</td>', 'Handsome picture.  The processing is handled artfully.  After that thread about fake sunbeams I''m now always wondering.  That''s a shame, but I''m not judging on this image.  Wonderful atmosphere.', '2017-12-17 11:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548738, 1208860, 173844, '<td valign="top">I often find such scenes daunting, but somehow this image is so full that it''s enjoyable, like an undefined puzzle.  You can just look so deeply into it, the traffic, the people and all the accoutrements of downtown bustle.  It''s like an outrageous pinball game.  I like phantasmagoria of lights.  Fun.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I often find such scenes daunting, but somehow this image is so full that it''s enjoyable, like an undefined puzzle.  You can just look so deeply into it, the traffic, the people and all the accoutrements of downtown bustle.  It''s like an outrageous pinball game.  I like phantasmagoria of lights.  Fun.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-12-17 13:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
