(7548811, 1209110, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, all blue and ethereal.  The symmetry serves the sci-fi mood, the sleekness of the oncoming future.  And so useful for those unfortunates, like the person on the right.  Captivating.</td>', 'Very nice image, all blue and ethereal.  The symmetry serves the sci-fi mood, the sleekness of the oncoming future.  And so useful for those unfortunates, like the person on the right.  Captivating.', '2017-12-17 23:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548812, 1209094, 173844, '<td valign="top">In this image is the reassurance of everyday beauty.  The messy earth blends into the lovely patches of color.  Pleasing composition.</td>', 'In this image is the reassurance of everyday beauty.  The messy earth blends into the lovely patches of color.  Pleasing composition.', '2017-12-17 23:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548815, 1209109, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stirring image of the rhythms of nature, sweetly caught in the blur of the offshore rowboat lifting and falling with the waves.  From foreground to background the moment unfolds in harmony.  The undulating line of trees is lovely.  The sepia is quite effective.</td>', 'Stirring image of the rhythms of nature, sweetly caught in the blur of the offshore rowboat lifting and falling with the waves.  From foreground to background the moment unfolds in harmony.  The undulating line of trees is lovely.  The sepia is quite effective.', '2017-12-17 23:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548816, 1208932, 173844, '<td valign="top">The man with the hounds-tooth pants adds a grace note to the essential jazziness of the shadows.  It''s a musical image, brassy and edgy, and it dances out from the people throwing these shadows onto the sidewalk.  A lovely appreciation.</td>', 'The man with the hounds-tooth pants adds a grace note to the essential jazziness of the shadows.  It''s a musical image, brassy and edgy, and it dances out from the people throwing these shadows onto the sidewalk.  A lovely appreciation.', '2017-12-17 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548817, 1209035, 173844, '<td valign="top">The most obvious pleasure of this image is the graceful placement of the people.  Then, as the title notes, we see them each in their own world, a triptych of anonymity.  The bus is a wonderful frame for it all.</td>', 'The most obvious pleasure of this image is the graceful placement of the people.  Then, as the title notes, we see them each in their own world, a triptych of anonymity.  The bus is a wonderful frame for it all.', '2017-12-17 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548819, 1208797, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image is like a flower, blossoming all around.  The generous vastness is very engaging.  It''s like a deep inhalation of cold, fresh air.</td>', 'This image is like a flower, blossoming all around.  The generous vastness is very engaging.  It''s like a deep inhalation of cold, fresh air.', '2017-12-17 23:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548821, 1209151, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific movement.  It''s a beautiful almost-abstract, full of planes and whoosh and even a flaming helmet.  Powerful.</td>', 'Terrific movement.  It''s a beautiful almost-abstract, full of planes and whoosh and even a flaming helmet.  Powerful.', '2017-12-17 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548823, 1209121, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sleek and other-worldly.  Effective as a cue to what''s coming rather than the train itself.  It''s kind of like a cut-away of a snake, its ribs and vertebrae.  Enjoyably suggestive.</td>', 'Sleek and other-worldly.  Effective as a cue to what''s coming rather than the train itself.  It''s kind of like a cut-away of a snake, its ribs and vertebrae.  Enjoyably suggestive.', '2017-12-17 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548824, 1209129, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming.</td>', 'Charming.', '2017-12-17 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7548825, 1209101, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yeah, he gave up on the sled years ago.  Norman Rockwell-ish, all it need is for him to be holding a can of Coke.  Enjoyable image.</td>', 'Yeah, he gave up on the sled years ago.  Norman Rockwell-ish, all it need is for him to be holding a can of Coke.  Enjoyable image.', '2017-12-17 23:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
