(7548869, 1209101, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent. This was my pick for a ribbon. Great work</td>', 'Excellent. This was my pick for a ribbon. Great work', '2017-12-18 03:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548871, 1209035, 19959, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the votes and kind comments. <br/> <br/>While I did set out to take an entry for this challenge I did not have much idea on what to capture on this morning. I headed to Waterloo Bridge on my morning commute with the idea to catch an interesting shot.<br/>This image was a quick grab shot as I reached the top of the stairs to the bridge. It was not until I went to edit the shots later that the composition of this image gave me the idea to frame like a tryptic and the different expressions on the passengers gave me an idea for a title...</td>', 'Thanks all for the votes and kind comments.  While I did set out to take an entry for this challenge I did not have much idea on what to capture on this morning. I headed to Waterloo Bridge on my morning commute with the idea to catch an interesting shot.This image was a quick grab shot as I reached the top of the stairs to the bridge. It was not until I went to edit the shots later that the composition of this image gave me the idea to frame like a tryptic and the different expressions on the passengers gave me an idea for a title...', '2017-12-18 03:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548876, 1208880, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes to the challenge<br/> <br/>Your image captures the mood well, a bunch of people all in the festive spirit and out to entertain each other and the crowds. Your position is good with the overhead decorations forming an integral part of the overall scene. In terms of the challenge brief, we dont really get a feeling of transportation simply because we are too close, it would have been better to be further away and show more of the bus preferably including the wheels.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes to the challenge Your image captures the mood well, a bunch of people all in the festive spirit and out to entertain each other and the crowds. Your position is good with the overhead decorations forming an integral part of the overall scene. In terms of the challenge brief, we dont really get a feeling of transportation simply because we are too close, it would have been better to be further away and show more of the bus preferably including the wheels.', '2017-12-18 05:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7548877, 1209101, 6130, '<td valign="top">Congrats Wonderful</td>', 'Congrats Wonderful', '2017-12-18 05:37:18.000000', NULL, 0),
